	UpgradeDescription(1)="Your Neurotoxin <font color=\"#399c0e\">adapts</font>. Hits on <font color=\"#8fce00\">Poisoned</font> ZEDs apply an additional <font color=\"#b346ea\">12</font> adaptive DoT based on the ZED's weakness."

